wrong[#####~\n#~~#~~\n#~~###\n##~#~#\n~####~]: The dots inside are walled off from every edge cell by `#`, so the sea fill never reaches them: they stay as dots.
wrong[#####~\n#..#..\n#..###\n##.#.#\n~####~]: (1, 4) and (1, 5) are joined to the edge cell (0, 5), so they're sea too.
